%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/operator_test.clj:248 (update-variable-binding-test)
testing: Update with variable binding: case age at .age -> age + 1
元の形: DW スクリプト
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
var myInput = {name: "Ken", age: 30}
---
myInput update {
  case age at .age -> age + 1
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "name": "Ken",
  "age": 31
}
